  "text": [
    "Boat anglers reported fair fishing.",
    "Some fish were caught, but they were very scattered.",
    "Anglers fished from 50 to around 100 feet of water, with some boats fishing well beyond that.",
    "The best bite was still with spoons.",
    "Anglers mostly caught Chinook salmon, with some steelhead mixed in.",
    "Pier fishing was a little slow.",
    "There were a couple of salmon caught by anglers casting spoons.",
    "Perch fishing was slow."
  ],
